{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24989","headline":"赠浙西李相公 · 牟融","name":"赠浙西李相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长庚烈烈独遥天，盛世应知降谪仙。\n月里昔曾分兔药，人间今喜得椿年。\n文章政事追先达，冠盖声华羡昔贤。\n尊酒与君称寿毕，春风入醉绮罗筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}